{"v": 1, "kind": "explainer", "title": "Gravity jet suit, schematic of the current layout with micro turbines", "primary": "solid", "notes": {"t": {"basis": "F2 and F3 Guinness World Records 2017, claimed"}}, "board": {"v": 1, "items": [{"id": "cap", "k": "text", "at": [6, 7], "text": "Jet suit, schematic"}]}, "solid": {"v": 2, "parts": [{"id": "pilot", "use": "mannequin", "with": {"leftShoulder": 30, "rightShoulder": 30, "leftElbow": 0, "rightElbow": 0}}, {"id": "armL", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 70, "length": 200}, "parent": "pilot.leftHand", "at": [0, -80, 100], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "armR", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 70, "length": 200}, "parent": "pilot.rightHand", "at": [0, -80, 100], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "bL", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 80, "length": 200}, "parent": "pilot.back", "at": [-110, 40, 60], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "bM", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 80, "length": 200}, "parent": "pilot.back", "at": [0, 40, 60], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "bR", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 80, "length": 200}, "parent": "pilot.back", "at": [110, 40, 60], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}], "annotations": {"labels": [{"id": "lSuit", "at": {"part": "pilot.head", "offset": [0, 0, 150]}, "text": "Mk4-style layout, 2020s (schematic)", "unchecked": "F5 Gravity Industries 2024, claimed"}, {"id": "lBack", "at": {"part": "bM.casing", "offset": [0, 0, 100]}, "text": "Three back turbines", "unchecked": "F5 Gravity Industries 2024, claimed"}, {"id": "lArm", "at": {"part": "armL.casing", "offset": [0, 0, 100]}, "text": "Arm engine (count schematic)", "unchecked": "F5 Gravity Industries 2024, claimed"}, {"id": "lThr", "at": {"part": "pilot.body", "offset": [-300, 0, 100]}, "text": "One thrust arrow for each engine", "unchecked": "schematic, thrust not modelled"}, {"id": "lF3", "at": {"part": "pilot.head", "offset": [0, 0, 220]}, "text": "2017 suit: 22 kg thrust each (claimed)", "unchecked": "F3 Guinness World Records 2017, claimed"}, {"id": "lEx", "at": {"part": "bM.casing", "offset": [0, 0, 150]}, "text": "Turbojet-style engine (example)"}, {"id": "lNot", "at": {"part": "bM.casing", "offset": [0, 0, 200]}, "text": "Not confirmed Gravity hardware"}, {"id": "lImp", "at": {"part": "bM.impeller", "offset": [0, 0, 0]}, "text": "Impeller"}, {"id": "lShaft", "at": {"part": "bM.shaft", "offset": [0, 0, 0]}, "text": "Shaft"}, {"id": "lDif", "at": {"part": "bM.diffuser", "offset": [0, 0, 0]}, "text": "Diffuser"}, {"id": "lComb", "at": {"part": "bM.combustor", "offset": [0, 0, 0]}, "text": "Combustor"}, {"id": "lTurb", "at": {"part": "bM.turbineWheel", "offset": [0, 0, 0]}, "text": "Turbine wheel"}, {"id": "lNoz", "at": {"part": "bM.nozzle", "offset": [0, 0, 0]}, "text": "Nozzle"}], "arrows": [{"id": "aW", "meaning": "force", "cause": "gravity", "from": {"part": "pilot.body", "offset": [260, 0, -100]}, "to": {"part": "pilot.body", "offset": [260, 0, -300]}, "text": "Weight of pilot and suit"}, {"id": "aTL", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "armL.casing", "offset": [0, 0, 100]}, "to": {"part": "armL.casing", "offset": [0, 0, -20]}}, {"id": "aTR", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "armR.casing", "offset": [0, 0, 100]}, "to": {"part": "armR.casing", "offset": [0, 0, -20]}}, {"id": "aTb1", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "bL.casing", "offset": [0, 0, 100]}, "to": {"part": "bL.casing", "offset": [0, 0, -20]}}, {"id": "aTb2", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "bM.casing", "offset": [0, 0, 100]}, "to": {"part": "bM.casing", "offset": [0, 0, -20]}}, {"id": "aTb3", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "bR.casing", "offset": [0, 0, 100]}, "to": {"part": "bR.casing", "offset": [0, 0, -20]}}, {"id": "aSteer", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "armR.casing", "offset": [0, 0, 160]}, "to": {"part": "armR.casing", "offset": [0, 0, 60]}, "text": "Tilted thrust (schematic)"}]}}, "beats": [{"say": "A pilot carries several small jet engines on the arms and back. This is the current layout, claimed by Gravity Industries, drawn as a schematic.", "highlight": ["armL", "armR", "bL", "bM", "bR"], "view": {"camera": "hero", "annotate": ["lSuit", "lBack", "lArm"]}}, {"say": "Weight pulls the pilot and suit down. Each engine pushes gas down, and the reaction thrust pushes up. In a hover these balance, along with the side forces and turning moments.", "highlight": ["aW", "aTL", "aTR", "aTb1", "aTb2", "aTb3"], "view": {"camera": "hero", "annotate": ["aW", "aTL", "aTR", "aTb1", "aTb2", "aTb3", "lThr"]}}, {"say": "Total thrust of the full suit is not published, so no ratio is drawn. The table shows only the claimed early suit figures, given with their source.", "highlight": ["t.r1", "t.r2"], "ops": [{"op": "add", "item": {"id": "t", "k": "table", "at": [6, 4], "header": true, "cells": [["2017 suit", "Value"], ["Turbines", 6], ["Thrust, kg", 22]]}}], "view": {"camera": "hero", "annotate": ["lF3"]}}, {"say": "Steering is claimed to be by body movement: the pilot moves arms and body to vector thrust. Here one arm is raised, so the engine fixed to that hand tilts and so does its thrust.", "highlight": ["armR", "aSteer"], "ops": [{"op": "remove", "id": "t"}], "view": {"camera": "hero", "pose": {"pilot": {"with": {"leftShoulder": 30, "rightShoulder": 70, "leftElbow": 0, "rightElbow": 0}}}, "annotate": ["aSteer", "aTL", "aTR", "aTb1", "aTb2", "aTb3"]}}, {"say": "Cut open one back engine, a schematic example, not Gravity hardware. Air enters the intake and the impeller flings it outward. Real inside parts are not published.", "highlight": ["bM.impeller", "bM.shaft"], "check": [{"value": "bM.input.speed", "eq": 1}], "view": {"camera": "hero", "section": {"normal": [1, 0, 0], "offset": 0, "parts": ["bM"]}, "ghost": ["pilot"], "hide": ["bL", "bR", "armL", "armR"], "focus": ["bM"], "spin": 1, "annotate": ["lEx", "lNot", "lImp", "lShaft"]}}, {"say": "The diffuser slows the air and raises its pressure. In the combustor, kerosene (verified fuel) burns with the oxygen in the compressed air.", "highlight": ["bM.diffuser", "bM.combustor"], "view": {"camera": "hero", "section": {"normal": [1, 0, 0], "offset": 0, "parts": ["bM"]}, "ghost": ["pilot"], "hide": ["bL", "bR", "armL", "armR"], "focus": ["bM"], "spin": 1, "annotate": ["lDif", "lComb"]}}, {"say": "The hot gas turns the turbine wheel on the same shaft as the impeller: {bM.input.speed} turn for each input turn. The gas leaves the nozzle, and thrust is the reaction to it.", "highlight": ["bM.turbineWheel", "bM.nozzle"], "check": [{"value": "bM.input.speed", "eq": 1}], "view": {"camera": "hero", "section": {"normal": [1, 0, 0], "offset": 0, "parts": ["bM"]}, "ghost": ["pilot"], "hide": ["bL", "bR", "armL", "armR"], "focus": ["bM"], "spin": 1, "annotate": ["lTurb", "lNoz"]}}, {"say": "Not shown: fuel system, harness, control electronics, and how load is shared between engines. Those shares and the true turbine internals are not published.", "highlight": ["pilot"], "view": {"camera": "hero", "annotate": []}}]}